tItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5017810,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5017810-1846651706694002","game_id":"steam-5017810","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.1: Tutorial Videos, Language Fix and More","summary":"Hi everyone! Thank you so much for playing the Gildoria demo during Next Fest. Your feedback has been amazing, and this small update fixes the issues many of you reported. FixesTutorial videos now play on all systems. Some videos used a format that Windows could not play without an extra codec, so they showed up blank for many players.The game no longer switches to Arabic the first time you open Settings.Your progress is safe. The update keeps your existing demo save, so you can continue where y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:16:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694002","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5017810-1846651706690584","game_id":"steam-5017810","kind":"announcement","title":"The Free Demo is Out Now!","summary":"The Gildoria demo is here! The dragon's hoard is a mess, and you are the one who has to put it in order. The free demo of Gildoria: Organize a Dragon's Hoard is now live on Steam, just in time for Steam Next Fest. What's in the demoSweep piles of gold coins and uncover the treasures buried beneathReturn each treasure to its rightful place on the shelves and complete collectionsEarn upgrades and new abilities as the hoard comes back to orderMeet the cats who keeps you company (yes, you can pet it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:47:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5017810-1842212951311101","game_id":"steam-5017810","kind":"announcement","title":"Gildoria's Art Is Now Fully Human Made!","summary":"Every piece of art in Gildoria is made by human artists.No ai generated images ship in this game. Not in the interface, not in the icons, not in the key art, not on this store page. What changedEarly in development I used AI-generated placeholders for parts of the interface while the underlying systems were being built. They were always meant to be temporary, and as of today not one of them is left in the build. Every placeholder has been replaced with work from real artists, either commissioned","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T18:06:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311101","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5017810-1841579228671371","game_id":"steam-5017810","kind":"announcement","title":"10,000+ wishlists in just 10 days","summary":"The dragon has been asleep for centuries and has no idea any of this is happening. 10.000+ of you have wishlisted his dungeon in just 10 days. I'm one person making this game on my own, and I did not expect that number this early. Thank you all! What you've been telling meThe most common comment on every post, by a wide margin: \"where's the dragon?\" Fair. He's the entire premise and right now you barely feel him. A few of you also said the dungeon reads more like a greedy king's vault than a pla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T13:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228